228
00:09:15,370 --> 00:09:17,640
- in the world, right?
- That's right.

229
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,100
- Really?
- That's why...

230
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:22,140
they even paid people...

231
00:09:22,940 --> 00:09:25,340
to come and dig up fossils.

232
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:27,040
Because there are so many.

233
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:29,940
