- If you find some, we'll pay you.

234
00:09:29,940 --> 00:09:30,940
(Every year, over 3,000 new pieces are discovered here.)

235
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:33,140
Can't you imagine dinosaurs roaming these grounds even now?

236
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:34,300
Seriously.

237
00:09:35,140 --> 00:09:36,770
What happened here?

238
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,940
They must've gone around going, "Roar!"

239
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,540
Right.

240
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:45,900
(We take in that era...)

241
00:09:45,900 --> 00:09:49,070
(we can no longer visit with our eyes.)

242
00:09:49,470 --> 00:09:50,840
This place...

243
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,870
is really worth visiting.

244
00:09:54,270 --> 00:09:56,670
This is definitely a place you need to come before you die.

245
00:09:57,540 --> 00:09:59,640
This history...

246
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:02,040
