1866
01:16:49,570 --> 01:16:53,300
(New activities that transcend time)

1867
01:16:53,500 --> 01:16:55,700
(That ride has been around since the 1800s?)

1868
01:16:55,700 --> 01:16:58,440
(This is pretty scary.)

1869
01:16:58,440 --> 01:17:00,140
(Screaming)

1870
01:17:00,140 --> 01:17:01,140
