1877
01:17:22,740 --> 01:17:24,240
(There it is.)

1878
01:17:24,670 --> 01:17:26,770
(Exclaiming)

1879
01:17:27,270 --> 01:17:29,040
(It looks like an actual wolf.)

1880
01:17:29,040 --> 01:17:30,770
(Wolf dogs with an overwhelming presence)

1881
01:17:31,240 --> 01:17:33,400
(It's too big.)

1882
01:17:33,610 --> 01:17:35,400
